IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `gdpr-core`
IMPORT `gdpr-core-2`
IMPORT `gdpr-definitions-2`
IMPORT `P2-art-19`

-- ============================================================================
-- P2-tests-art-19.l4 -- tests of Article 19 (src:250-252).
-- Every expected value was written by hand from the text of the provision named in the comment above it,
-- before the first run, and none was copied from an output (notes/gen-tests-p2.py holds the cases).
-- A #TRACE result is not an assertion and check.sh does not count it; each trace comment gives the expected result.
-- ============================================================================

§ `Art 19, first sentence: communicate to each recipient, unless impossible or disproportionate`

-- a rectification carried out, a recipient (a legal person to whom the data were disclosed), communicated
#ASSERT `Art 19 the controller communicates any rectification, erasure or restriction of processing to each recipient to whom the personal data have been disclosed` TRUE `legal person` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE NOTHING EQUALS JUST `the duty arises and is met`
-- not communicated: 'shall communicate'
#ASSERT `Art 19 the controller communicates any rectification, erasure or restriction of processing to each recipient to whom the personal data have been disclosed` TRUE `legal person` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE NOTHING EQUALS JUST `the duty arises and is not met`
-- the recipient is a third party: 'whether a third party or not' (Article 4(9)), so still a recipient
#ASSERT `Art 19 the controller communicates any rectification, erasure or restriction of processing to each recipient to whom the personal data have been disclosed` TRUE `legal person` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE NOTHING EQUALS JUST `the duty arises and is not met`
-- communicating proves impossible or involves disproportionate effort: 'unless'
#ASSERT `Art 19 the controller communicates any rectification, erasure or restriction of processing to each recipient to whom the personal data have been disclosed` TRUE `legal person` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE NOTHING EQUALS JUST `the duty does not arise`
-- no rectification, erasure or restriction carried out: nothing to communicate; the text is silent
#ASSERT `Art 19 the controller communicates any rectification, erasure or restriction of processing to each recipient to whom the personal data have been disclosed` FALSE `legal person` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
-- the data were not disclosed to the body: it is not a recipient (Article 4(9)), outside 'each recipient'
#ASSERT `Art 19 the controller communicates any rectification, erasure or restriction of processing to each recipient to whom the personal data have been disclosed` TRUE `legal person` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
-- a public authority that receives the data in a particular inquiry in accordance with law is 'not regarded as a recipient' (Article 4(9))
#ASSERT `Art 19 the controller communicates any rectification, erasure or restriction of processing to each recipient to whom the personal data have been disclosed` TRUE `public authority` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
-- a public authority in an inquiry NOT in accordance with law is a recipient
#ASSERT `Art 19 the controller communicates any rectification, erasure or restriction of processing to each recipient to whom the personal data have been disclosed` TRUE `public authority` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE NOTHING EQUALS JUST `the duty arises and is not met`
-- a body that is not a natural or legal person, public authority, agency or other body is not a recipient
#ASSERT `Art 19 the controller communicates any rectification, erasure or restriction of processing to each recipient to whom the personal data have been disclosed` TRUE `not a person or body` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
-- Article 11(2) disapplies Articles 15 to 20 (Article 19 is among them)
#ASSERT `Art 19 the controller communicates any rectification, erasure or restriction of processing to each recipient to whom the personal data have been disclosed` TRUE `legal person` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST `the duty does not arise`
-- an Article 11(2) case with identifying information: the article applies; communicated
#ASSERT `Art 19 the controller communicates any rectification, erasure or restriction of processing to each recipient to whom the personal data have been disclosed` TRUE `legal person` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST `the duty arises and is met`
-- FULFILLED: the controller communicates
#TRACE `Art 19 the controller must communicate the rectification, erasure or restriction of processing to each recipient` TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY controller DOES `Art 19 communicate the rectification, erasure or restriction of processing to each recipient to whom the personal data have been disclosed` AT 1
-- no act: the obligation stands; no breach is possible (no time limit)
#TRACE `Art 19 the controller must communicate the rectification, erasure or restriction of processing to each recipient` TRUE AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 1000)
-- FULFILLED: no duty to communicate arises
#TRACE `Art 19 the controller must communicate the rectification, erasure or restriction of processing to each recipient` FALSE AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 1000)

§ `Art 19, second sentence: informing the data subject about the recipients`

-- requested, and the controller informed the data subject
#ASSERT `Art 19 the controller informs the data subject about those recipients if the data subject requests it` TRUE TRUE NOTHING EQUALS JUST `the duty arises and is met`
-- requested, and not informed: 'shall inform'
#ASSERT `Art 19 the controller informs the data subject about those recipients if the data subject requests it` TRUE FALSE NOTHING EQUALS JUST `the duty arises and is not met`
-- not requested: 'if the data subject requests it' fails
#ASSERT `Art 19 the controller informs the data subject about those recipients if the data subject requests it` FALSE FALSE NOTHING EQUALS JUST `the duty does not arise`
-- not requested, informed in any case: the duty did not arise
#ASSERT `Art 19 the controller informs the data subject about those recipients if the data subject requests it` FALSE TRUE NOTHING EQUALS JUST `the duty does not arise`
-- Article 11(2) disapplies Articles 15 to 20 (Article 19 is among them): no duty to inform, whatever the controller did (R9)
#ASSERT `Art 19 the controller informs the data subject about those recipients if the data subject requests it` TRUE FALSE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST `the duty does not arise`
-- an Article 11(2) case with identifying information: the article applies; requested and not informed
#ASSERT `Art 19 the controller informs the data subject about those recipients if the data subject requests it` TRUE FALSE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST `the duty arises and is not met`
-- an Article 11(2) case with identifying information: requested and informed
#ASSERT `Art 19 the controller informs the data subject about those recipients if the data subject requests it` TRUE TRUE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST `the duty arises and is met`
-- FULFILLED: the controller informs
#TRACE `Art 19 the controller must inform the data subject about those recipients if the data subject requests it` TRUE NOTHING AT 0 WITH
    PARTY controller DOES `Art 19 inform the data subject about those recipients` AT 1
-- no act: the obligation stands; no breach is possible (no time limit)
#TRACE `Art 19 the controller must inform the data subject about those recipients if the data subject requests it` TRUE NOTHING AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 1000)
-- FULFILLED: no request
#TRACE `Art 19 the controller must inform the data subject about those recipients if the data subject requests it` FALSE NOTHING AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 1000)
-- FULFILLED: Article 11(2) disapplies Articles 15 to 20, so there is no duty to inform (R9)
#TRACE `Art 19 the controller must inform the data subject about those recipients if the data subject requests it` TRUE (JUST TRUE) AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 1000)
